                                                "sense_id": "dccc7798-3394-31e5-ae5f-0d05f1ba7bc6",
                                                "text": "Yet the initial IMF rescue plan was far from the parachute which it professed to be – the chute did open briefly but only for it to \"Roman candle\", the hapless victim left to plummet to earth with a sickening thud."
                                            },
                                            {
